<p>A private transfer from Bilbao Airport (BIO) to Hotel Carlton covers about 12 kilometres and takes around 15 minutes by car, running from the terminal at Loiu into the heart of Bilbao's Ensanche district and Plaza Federico Moyúa, where the hotel's Beaux-Arts facade has anchored one of the city's grandest squares since 1926. Your driver meets you at arrivals with a name board, tracks your flight automatically so a late landing never leaves you stranded, and drops you directly at the hotel's entrance on the square.</p>
