<p>This focus sits comfortably alongside the hotel's practical, transport-led setting. For a guest with mobility needs in particular, avoiding a long walk or an extra taxi between the station and the hotel door is itself a meaningful accessibility benefit, on top of whatever adaptations exist inside the building.</p>
