<p>Because Bilbao Airport sits outside the city in Loiu, and many guests at this particular hotel are working around a specific train departure or arrival time, a private transfer with flight tracking built in ensures the airport leg of the journey doesn't create unnecessary pressure on a tight rail connection. Drivers are available for early-morning and late-night arrivals alike.</p>
